      "message": "Power consumption in deep sleep on cros/main\n```\n@@               NAME  COUNT  AVERAGE  STDDEV      MAX      MIN\n@@       sample_msecs    512   117.16   16.01   343.78   104.66\n@@    pp1800_dx_fp_mv    512  1808.00    0.00  1808.00  1808.00\n@@    pp1800_dx_fp_mw    512     1.01    0.01     1.16     1.01\n@@    pp3300_dx_fp_mv    512  3288.00    0.00  3288.00  3288.00\n@@    pp3300_dx_fp_mw    512     0.00    0.03     0.26     0.00\n@@   pp3300_dx_mcu_mv    512  3288.00    0.00  3288.00  3288.00\n@@   pp3300_dx_mcu_mw    512     2.09    0.05     2.10     1.84\n```\nPower consumption in deep sleep with all patches applied\n```\n@@               NAME  COUNT  AVERAGE  STDDEV      MAX      MIN\n@@       sample_msecs    313   192.17   19.64   425.28   181.36\n@@    pp1800_dx_fp_mv    313  1808.00    0.00  1808.00  1808.00\n@@    pp1800_dx_fp_mw    313     1.01    0.00     1.01     1.01\n@@    pp3300_dx_fp_mv    313  3288.00    0.00  3288.00  3288.00\n@@    pp3300_dx_fp_mw    313     0.00    0.02     0.26     0.00\n@@   pp3300_dx_mcu_mv    313  3288.00    0.00  3288.00  3288.00\n@@   pp3300_dx_mcu_mw    313     2.10    0.04     2.10     1.84\n```\n\nI will prepare firmware and run it on hatch for a weekend, so I\u0027ll get information about number of prevented sleep.",
      "parentUuid": "e83fed1f_7596db45",
